error[E0270]: string literal escapes do not form valid UTF-8
 --> $DIR/escape-invalid-utf8.nra:4:12
  |
4 | let lone = "caf\xE9";
  |            ^^^^^^^^^
  |                ---- this byte does not form a valid UTF-8 sequence here
  |
  = note: a string holds UTF-8 text: \xHH escapes must together form UTF-8 sequences, as \xC3\xA9 does for U+00E9
help: to write the code point U+00E9, use a Unicode escape
  |
4 | let lone = "caf\u{E9}";
  |                ~~~~~~

