error[E0104]: invalid string escape
 --> $DIR/escape-invalid-utf8.nra:9:14
  |
9 | let short = "\x4G";
  |              ^^^ \x takes exactly two hexadecimal digits
  |
  = note: the escapes are \n, \r, \t, \0, \\, \', \", \xHH with two hexadecimal digits, and \u{H} with one to six hexadecimal digits

Some errors have detailed explanations: E0104, E0270.
For more information about an error, try `neura explain E0104`.
